  "readmeFile": "docs/README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release of MSQLite.Wrapper.Core targeting .NET 8.0 (x64/x86).\n\n\tHighlights:\n\t- C++/CLI wrapper for SQLite with ergonomic managed API and ORM-style access.\n\t- Platform-specific builds for x64 and x86, including ijwhost.dll for mixed-mode activation.\n\t- Integrated encryption support via SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers (AES, ChaCha20, etc.).\n\t- FastLZ compression for strings and binary data via MSQLite.Fastlz.\n\t- ICU support for Unicode collation and locale-aware sorting.\n\t- Debugging support via PDB symbols.\n\t- Includes a complete runnable example (Program.cs) and README documentation.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Managed SQLite wrapper with encryption, compression, and ORM features.",
  "title": "MSQLite C++/CLI Wrapper (.NET 8.0)",
